{"about_the_game":"Lucid Path is an experiment, an attempt to create a game which is one of its kind. At its core, it is a story rich RPG dungeon crawler with semi automatic turn based battles. The time you can spend in the dungeon is determined by your health points and when it goes to 0, you must leave the dungeon and regenerate it. It can be done by working or doing quests which can be progressed by... playing fast paced mini games.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Turn-based battles against dangerous monsters for their treasures<br></li><li>Quests and work that can be done by playing one of five different mini games<br></li><li>Many different weapons, armors and spells<br></li><li>An interesting story<br></li><li>A talking Cactus!</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"b25687d1012e23491d5c7493e09b5ac14ee141f8.jpg","localized_name":"Good at Planetoids","name":"Good at Planetoids","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/917910/b25687d1012e23491d5c7493e09b5ac14ee141f8.jpg"},{"icon":"7d43b7c854bbfb4978e4c287e5f560dbc0357ee9.jpg","localized_name":"Great at Planetoids","name":"Great at Planetoids","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/917910/7d43b7c854bbfb4978e4c287e5f560dbc0357ee9.jpg"},{"icon":"3a0f65541c966d07bda2852ed5069381313f78dc.jpg","localized_name":"Good at Wormhole Traveler","name":"Good at Wormhole Traveler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/917910/3a0f65541c966d07bda2852ed5069381313f78dc.jpg"},{"icon":"33a2d95da04f152b15478fbeaa946995a1f38b05.jpg","localized_name":"Great at Wormhloe Traveler","name":"Great at Wormhloe Traveler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/917910/33a2d95da04f152b15478fbeaa946995a1f38b05.jpg"},{"icon":"d43d0b4a797be7fb3c35a4290dbe0bf6bcc2806e.jpg","localized_name":"Good at Ancient Warrior","name":"Good at Ancient Warrior","path":"https://c